{"blocks": [{"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobTLCHRO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "♡˚✧₊"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mob9ahECi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会いに来てくださってありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobPyjKrr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また楽しい時間を過ごすことが出来ました！❤︎\nみなさんとお話しする時間が1番大好きです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんも私と話す時間が1番好きだったら両思いですね🫶🏻\n私だけそう思っていたら寂しいです🥹💛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またみなさんにお会いできることを楽しみにしています♫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobmJH65N.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんなにたくさんのお花🌼！\nすごく嬉しいです😭😭😭🥹"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobTQINDz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんのお花に囲まれてとても幸せです♪\n黄色のお花は「幸福」「感謝」「希望」などの意味があるみたいです！\nいつもファンの皆さんのおかげで幸福と感謝を得ることができて、明治神宮野球場で「君の名は希望」を歌わせていただいたのでどれも私に共通しています🌼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて私のメンバーカラーが黄色でよかったなと思いました💛💛"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にありがとうございます😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またブログ送信するので待っててください〜❤︎"}], "source": "official"}